A.text:
Use `DATATABLE`, which lets you define column names, types, and literal rows inline.

```dax
EVALUATE
DATATABLE(
    "Product", STRING,
    "Sales", INTEGER,
    {
        {"Widget", 100},
        {"Gadget", 150}
    }
)
```

